Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Fix failed-result observer process and launch source
 guards

Use the non-signalling psutil existence probe while retaining birth and zombie identity vetoes. Resolve both launch working directories through the canonical install-root helper and accept BOM-prefixed readiness acknowledgements. Document the intentional outlives-writer detached lifecycle using the checker's supported per-site contract; owner-death registration would destroy independent reconciliation.

Proof: scripts/check: 18 checks ok; canonical runner: 1189 passed, 0 failed across six files, including generation fencing, real-process reconciliation and both subprocess source scanners. Six targeted regressions failed before the fix.
